{"version":1,"content":"<p>儘管網絡安全公司和專家多年來不斷警告弱密碼帶來的風險，但大量用户依然傾向於使用簡單、容易預測的登錄憑證。最新研究顯示，便利性和易記性仍然是人們設置密碼時最重要的考慮因素，而安全性往往被放在次要位置。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586878.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.079625+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:56:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:50.078754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:50.078754+00:00","content_hash":"a45ff72df153ee91f8546073c1a739673c3b2d243a428b6c8f54a142499268a5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}